🔀 Other
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📊 &lt;a href="https://survey.devographics.com/en-US/survey/state-of-css/2026?source=this_week_in_react" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;State of CSS 2026 - Survey is now open&lt;/a&gt;
